    "created_at": "2023-06-15T12:38:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-06-15T12:38:55Z",
    "body": "This could also enable developers to unpair/forget a currently disconnected device. \r\n\r\nNow such device management feature can be emulated by saving every paired devices to localStorage, and ignore any \"forgotten\" devices from `getDevices`' result. However, users could unpair devices from browsers' permission settings and there is no method to sync that info.",
